APEX hpx_v1.11.0: include fixed-width integer declarations for GCC 15
and resolve no-BFD function names using the original runtime address.
This complements hpx_apex_tau.patch; either patch can be applied first.

Base revision: 151f5535f58f94cab264bbf8af306589e418d283
Apply from the dependency source root with git apply --check, then git apply.
Rebuild and reinstall that dependency after applying the patch.

